  "notes": "Monochrome black/white e-commerce template (Shop.co by Hamza Naeem): heavy pill shapes (9999px radius) for search, chips, buttons and discount badges; 20px-radius product image tiles on warm grey #f0eeed with cut-out apparel photos; filter panel is an outlined 20px-radius card with thin dividers. Only colour comes from product photos, yellow stars, red discount pills and the colour swatches. Newsletter block is a black rounded slab that straddles the white page and the grey footer. Footer column headings use letter-spaced uppercase. Shop nav item opens a two-column mega panel of label+description links. Result count says 1-10 of 100 but only 9 cards render."
